Cell["\<\
The interval abundances of the 4 \[Times] 4 diamond of the lattice: 24 links, \
16 pairs with one event between, and the one pair of tips with all 14 others \
between.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"b7979d4d-9480-4e18-80b6-a2760b9c1ee6"],

