Cell["\<\
The Benincasa\[Dash]Dowker operator of the 2 \[Times] 2 diamond: \[Minus]2 on \
the diagonal, 4 on each link below the diagonal in the sorted event order, \
and the discrete curvature it assigns to each event.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"51f8eea0-ac77-4d95-9a61-476a2c061d56"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", "\n", "  ", 
